Error [jet.MissingMoveMarker]: `value` cannot be moved from borrowed storage
  --> tests/ui/param_owned_callback_needs_copy.jet:5:66
    |
  5 | wrap: fn(value: fn(Int) -> Int) -> Holder { return Holder{value: value} }
    |                                                                  ^^^^^
 Why: `value` is a read or write parameter, so its caller keeps the value, and `fn(Int) -> Int` can't be copied into the struct literal
 Fix: Declare the parameter `value: &&fn(Int) -> Int` so the caller hands the value over
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0201
